# Scilab: Scilab 2024 help: language syntax; requirements/languages/scilab.md
name     scilab sce sci
keyword  function endfunction if then else elseif end for while do select case break continue return
keyword  try catch global
builtin  disp printf mprintf zeros ones size length plot %pi %e %t %f %T %F
ident-extra    %
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
operators  +-*/^\=<>~&|:.'
calls
